          "id": 2214876567,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It was when I upgraded to GCC 14.1 that I started getting the warning on the Lemon generated code. Looking, it does seem that GCC 13 understands the warning, it just doesn't seem to emit it on the Lemon code.\n\nNot a problem to disable it on earlier versions that understand the warning, I concur.",
